    "lower_garage": "The lower sheet shows a two-car garage in the same footprint as the main-floor garage. Until that is confirmed to be a second physical room, the lower garage is drawn (geometry.py) but NOT bound here, so the GDO doors and locks never appear on two floors at once.",
    "bathroom": "The only bathroom entity in HA is switch.z_wave_plus_on_off_toggle_switch_2 (friendly name 'Bathroom'); it is a Z-Wave toggle, so it is bound as a switch, not as primary_light. switch.z_wave_plus_on_off_toggle_switch ('Bathroom Toilet') is the toilet's own switch and is deliberately not on the plan.",
    "dining_room": "The dining room's sensors carry a 'basement_motion_' entity_id but are friendly-named 'Dining room Motion'; bound as temp + motion on that basis. Its temperature reports in Fahrenheit, so the pill carries °F rather than being converted -- the number matches HA's more-info dialog.",
